'''The Big Bang''' is the 48th and final stage in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. This stage introduces [[The Cat God]], [[Cat God]] and [[Final Boss Giga-God]] as the bosses of their respective chapters. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] are unlocked. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]] is unlocked and, for the '''Southeast Asia''' version, [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] is unlocked.

