==Trivia==
*The Big Bang has its own theme, officially named "Big Bang Kumikyoku" (ビッグバン組曲, "Big Bang Suite") in the Battle Cats CD. So far, it can only be heard here, in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]], in the [[Moon (Aku Realm)|Aku Realms Moon/Iriomote]], in [[Ape Lord's Revenge]], in the [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]], or in [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)]].
*The background for this stage is the same as the one used in [[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]], but altered to more closely resemble a scorched field of nothingness.
**The enemy base is also similar to Black Hole's, except that the tree has opened up and formed a portal.
**This variant of Black Hole's background is unique to the Big Bang, only found elsewhere in the [[Seven Shining Colors of Justice]].
*Excluding [[The Aku Realms]] and Zombie Outbreaks, The Big Bang is the only stage of the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] in which [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|The Cat God]] cannot be used.
**This [https://youtu.be/FvjsgoJoNyA wasn't the case] in the now-defunct [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]], however.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], since [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] are not present, the first two bosses are [[J.K. Bun Bun]] and [[Bun Bun Black]]. After defeating those two bosses and dealing some base damage, [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] appears as the final boss.

